## Automated security baseline

🟡 **Manual review required at commit `59be583…`.**

Selective policy permits an authorized marketplace maintainer to accept these non-blocking findings and capabilities for this exact commit through `approved-and-verified`; otherwise apply the accepted fixes.

### Findings requiring review

#### Downloaded content is passed directly to a shell (`curl-pipe-shell`)

The remote response is executed immediately and is not bound to the commit reviewed for this submission.

- [`install.sh:2`](https://github.com/example/omarchy-plugin-clockwork/blob/59be5837842bd079c2872c42d472e0e5c2c9dd22/install.sh#L2)

      curl -fsSL https://example.invalid/setup.sh \| sh

Accepted fixes:
- Remove the download-and-execute installation path.
- Use a trusted package manager or another installation path that does not execute downloaded content.

### Capabilities detected

#### Installer or setup path (`installer`)

Installer code can modify the user environment and needs a maintainer to confirm its documented scope.

